---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Me" description="A little bit about me, my interests, and my journey.">
    <div class="about-container">

        <div class="hero-orb">
            <div class="orb"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card">
            <h1>About Me</h1>
            
            <p>Hey, I'm Komyl. My journey took a bit of a scenic route—I started out in medicine before making a sharp turn into the world of computing. I guess I've always been drawn to complex systems, whether it's the human body or a cryptographic algorithm.</p>
            <p>I'm fascinated by cryptography and the art of breaking things to find their weaknesses. It’s a passion that extends from software bugs to tinkering with hardware. Outside of the digital world, I enjoy the strategic depth of chess, the logic of mathematics, and getting lost in research on whatever has captured my curiosity this week.</p>
            <p>Travel is a big part of my life; there's a unique thrill in exploring new places. I also have a deep appreciation for art and music. While I don't like putting myself in a box, I suppose "geek" comes pretty close.</p>
            <p>At my core, I'm driven by a strong belief in freedom in all its forms—from free speech and open-source software to a decentralized, open internet. Computers and networks have been my playground since I was a kid, especially the intricate dance of the internet and its security.</p>
            <p>I often write scripts for fun or for work, build software when inspiration strikes, and contribute to open-source projects that I find cool. This blog is one of my homes on the web, but you can find me in other places too.</p>

            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="/contact" class="button primary">Get in Touch</a>
                <a href="https://linktr.ee/komylf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button secondary">Find Me Elsewhere</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-container {
        padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4) 0;
    }
    .hero-orb {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        height: 250px;
        margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 6);
        perspective: 1000px;
    }
    .orb {
        width: 150px;
        height: 150px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.1)),
                    conic-gradient(from 90deg at 50% 50%, #5B21B6, #D946EF, #A3E635, #22D3EE, #60A5FA, #A78BFA, #5B21B6);
        position: relative;
        animation: rotate-hue 10s linear infinite, float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    }
    .hero-orb:hover .orb {
        transform: scale(1.1) rotateY(20deg) rotateX(10deg);
        animation-play-state: paused;
    }

    @keyframes rotate-hue {
        to { filter: hue-rotate(360deg); }
    }
    @keyframes float {
        0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
    }

    .content-card {
        background-color: var(--glass-background);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        border-radius: var(--border-radius-large);
        padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 5);
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 3);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }
    .content-card p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 1.5em;
    }
    .cta-buttons {
        margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 5);
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2);
    }
    .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .button.primary {
        background-color: var(--color-primary);
        color: white;
    }
    .button.secondary {
        background-color: var(--glass-border);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }
</style>